une 500", "year": 2021, "rank": 177, "itemDescription": "The multinational medical company orchestrates multiple divisions that supply institutions, laboratories, and companies with goods and services for medical research."}, {"slug": "fortune500", "title": "Fortune 500", "year": 2020, "rank": 187, "itemDescription": "Medical tech company Becton Dickinson makes devices and instruments that are used by health care professionals and medical researchers. Among its products are reagents used in testing for COVID-19."}, {"slug": "change-the-world", "title": "Change the World", "year": 2020, "rank": 36, "itemDescription": "As a major manufacturer of medical supplies, from injection devices to the medication delivery systems used in ICUs, BD has been in overdrive lately\u2014in some cases making more of a product in a single week that it had during the whole previous year, to meet COVID-19 demand. But BD has gone beyond merely ramping up. It has installed medical equipment at emergency field hospitals; it has provided infection surveillance data to the CDC; and it has worked with governments and NGOs worldwide to get immunization supplies ready for the eventual arrival of a vaccine."}, {"slug": "worlds-most-admired-companies", "title": "World's Most Admired Companies", "year": 2019, "rank": null, "itemDescription": ""}, {"slug": "fortune500", "title": "Fortune 500", "year": 2019, "rank": 195, "itemDescription": ""}, {"slug": "fortune500", "title": "Fortune 500", "year": 2018, "rank": 251, "itemDescription": ""}, {"slug": "worlds-most-admired-companies", "title": "World's Most Admired Companies", "year": 2017, "rank": null, "itemDescription": ""}, {"slug": "fortune500", "title": "Fortune 500", "year": 2017, "rank": 225, "itemDescription": ""}, {"slug": "fortune500", "title": "Fortune 500", "year": 2016, "rank": 278, "itemDescription": ""}, {"slug": "change-the-world", "title": "Change the World", "year": 2016, "rank": 37, "itemDescription": ""}, {"slug": "worlds-most-admire